From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 18:27:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 460/572] fix(st): remove redundant fd initializations in
 stm32image_create_header_file
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Remove redundant initializations of dest_fd and src_fd before their
open() assignments.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 759a4c73d50118bc560a6630affc5c3a19d48170 fix(st): remove redundant fd initializations in stm32image_create_header_file]
Change-Id: I6fb7f35dc2448e74b722f42cee7402f9d577460c
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/558050
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 tools/stm32image/stm32image.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/stm32image/stm32image.c b/tools/stm32image/stm32image.c
index f7af611898..4e69776a7a 100644
--- a/tools/stm32image/stm32image.c
+++ b/tools/stm32image/stm32image.c
@@ -264,7 +264,7 @@ static int stm32image_create_header_file(char *srcname, char *destname,
 					 uint32_t version, uint32_t major,
 					 uint32_t minor, uint32_t binary_type)
 {
-	int src_fd = -1, dest_fd = -1;
+	int src_fd, dest_fd;
 	struct stat sbuf;
 	unsigned char *ptr = NULL;
 	void *stm32image_header;
